/T (Who can I talk to about paying tuition, fees, housing, or health insurance? All payments can be submitted on the student portal. Edie Millet, our Bursar, is your go-to person for any billing questions and financial concerns you might have. She oversees the in-person billing process for tuition, fees, housing, and health insurance, and also manages payments from students and families. To schedule a meeting with Edie, visit the Front Desk, where our Front Desk Receptionist, Lesley Jimenez, can set up a time for you. )
