851 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Why do I have to have health insurance while attending San Francisco Bay University? Your overall wellness is a priority at San Francisco Bay University! We want to make sure that students are protected from any unforeseen medical situations. Medical expenses in the United States can place an incredible amount of financial stress on individuals and their families with little or no medical insurance coverage. Additionally, we want all students to have the opportunity to receive and engage in preventative care to ensure that our campus community remains healthy. A student's success is dependent on their overall wellness.)
/E (Why do I have to have health insurance while attending San Francisco Bay University? Your overall wellness is a priority at San Francisco Bay University! We want to make sure that students are protected from any unforeseen medical situations. Medical expenses in the United States can place an incredible amount of financial stress on individuals and their families with little or no medical insurance coverage. Additionally, we want all students to have the opportunity to receive and engage in preventative care to ensure that our campus community remains healthy. A student's success is dependent on their overall wellness.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
852 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (What are my options in obtaining health insurance while attending SFBU?   San Francisco Bay University is committed to providing a health insurance plan to our international and domestic students that is affordable while meeting the University's requirements in coverage that best protects our students. Students will have an option to select individual plans that are comparable in coverage for either international or domestic students. Students will need to submit a request for a waiver from the group insurance plan. Students who are dependents on a parent's or spouse's employer plan or on Medi-Cal may request a waiver from the group insurance plan. Waivers from the group insurance plan must be submitted by the deadline specified. For more information, please visit the Student Health Insurance webpage.)
/E (What are my options in obtaining health insurance while attending SFBU?   San Francisco Bay University is committed to providing a health insurance plan to our international and domestic students that is affordable while meeting the University's requirements in coverage that best protects our students. Students will have an option to select individual plans that are comparable in coverage for either international or domestic students. Students will need to submit a request for a waiver from the group insurance plan. Students who are dependents on a parent's or spouse's employer plan or on Medi-Cal may request a waiver from the group insurance plan. Waivers from the group insurance plan must be submitted by the deadline specified. For more information, please visit the Student Health Insurance webpage.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
